    <TD STYLE="border-top: #5F6062 1pt solid; border-bottom: #5F6062 1pt solid; padding: 0.05in 2.9pt 10pt; background-color: #D9D9D9; line-height: 107%"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%">5.00pm (Sydney time) Tuesday 10 December 2024</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
