    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: #5F6062 1pt solid; padding: 0.05in 2.9pt 10pt; background-color: #D9D9D9; line-height: 107%"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%"><B>8.30am (Sydney time) Thursday 12 December 2024</B></FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: #5F6062 1pt solid; padding: 0.05in 2.9pt 10pt; line-height: 107%"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%">Last day to reposition Shares between the Australian principal and United States branch share registers</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: #5F6062 1pt solid; padding: 0.05in 2.9pt 10pt; background-color: #D9D9D9; line-height: 107%"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%">Friday, 13 December 2024</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: #5F6062 1pt solid; padding: 0.05in 2.9pt 10pt; line-height: 107%"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%">Election
    date: Last date by which the Share Registry must receive an election from Small Parcel Holders who wish to opt in to participating
    in the Sale Facility, or withdraw a previous election made</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: #5F6062 1pt solid; padding: 0.05in 2.9pt 10pt; background-color: #D9D9D9; line-height: 107%"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%">5.00pm on Friday, 13 December 2024</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: #5F6062 1pt solid; padding: 0.05in 2.9pt 10pt; line-height: 107%"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%">Second Court Hearing for approval of the Scheme</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: #5F6062 1pt solid; padding: 0.05in 2.9pt 10pt; background-color: #D9D9D9; line-height: 107%"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%">3.00pm Monday 16 December 2024</FONT></TD></TR>
