    <TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; padding: 4pt 3pt 12pt 5pt; text-align: left"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">The directors of Bionomics have considered the proposed Scheme to evaluate the terms of the proposed Scheme, reach an independent conclusion on whether the Scheme is in the best interests of Bionomics Shareholders, and make an independent recommendation to Bionomics Shareholders on how to vote on the Scheme.</FONT></TD>
