    <TD STYLE="border-top: Black 1pt solid; padding: 4pt 3pt 4pt 5pt; width: 23%; border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-left: Black 1pt solid; background-color: white"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><B>What do the Bionomics Board members recommend?</B></FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-top: Black 1pt solid; padding: 4pt 3pt 4pt 5pt; width: 65%; border-right: Black 1pt solid">
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">The Bionomics Board members unanimously recommend
    that Bionomics Shareholders <B>vote in favour of the Scheme</B>, subject to the Independent Expert continuing to conclude that the Scheme
    is in the best interests of Bionomics Shareholders.</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">The interests held by the members of the Bionomics
    Board are disclosed in section 12.1 of this Scheme Booklet. The following Bionomics Board members have a Relevant Interest in Bionomics
    Shares:<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><SUP>5</SUP></FONT></P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P></TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-top: Black 1pt solid; padding: 4pt 3pt 4pt 5pt; width: 12%; border-right: Black 1pt solid"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Sections 1.5, and 12.1</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>

